// "Use in project": turn a catalog item into project content, with every identifier in the project's OWN
// reserved namespace (lib/cyrus/engine-core/identifiers.ts). Pure apart from the injected `reserve` (in the portal:
// engine-core/store reserveIdentifier(projectId, kind, key); tests use a fake). The caller runs the browse gate
// first; this module re-checks nothing about plans (it is also used for content already in the project).
//  - texture template -> a TextureSpec named after the slot key, drawn with the chosen ramps and the MOD's Style
