3	// For each listed entry: every recipe that applies (thumb@1, bundle@1, glb-opt@1, preview-ogg@1), generated through
4	// LibraryStore (lazy, cached), then a SECOND pass that must be served from the cache. Tools come from
5	// CYRUS_LIBRARY_FFMPEG / _PYTHON / _GLTF_TRANSFORM (unset = honestly reported as tool_missing).
